        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M19",
            "speaker_id": 61232,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, I've uploaded the draft 'Sales Pitch and Objection Handling Guide' to A2, covering T2. I've also outlined a proposed training schedule in A5 as part of T5. Please review and provide feedback so we can finalize our sales enablement approach.",
