            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 30302,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "In the objection handling part of A2, you have a response for 'it's too expensive'. Should we offer discounts?",
            "mentions": [
              61232
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 61232,
            "reply_to": "M21",
            "text": "No, the strategy is to pivot back to the value and the ROI, not to discount. The guide explicitly states that. We need to maintain margin integrity. Any discounting would need to be a separate, structured campaign approved by finance, not ad-hoc.",
            "mentions": [
              30302
