            "speaker_id": 285875,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, as part of T4 and T8, I've completed the initial data audit and drafted the 'Membership Data Fields and Tagging Matrix' in A4. The audit report from T8 is attached in the comments of A4. There are some data quality issues we need to address. Please review and let's discuss the scope of the pre-launch clean-up.",
