            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 61232,
            "reply_to": "M38",
            "text": "It's a significant problem. We can't accurately target long-standing members for upgrade offers without it. This needs to be a priority for the clean-up. We should aim to get that gap below 5% before launch.",
            "mentions": [
              30302
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 285875,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "I agree. The audit also flagged inconsistent formatting in the 'Segment' field. That will mess up our reporting. I propose we prioritize two clean-up actions from T8 before launch: 1) Back-filling missing 'Join Date' from billing records, and 2) Standardizing all 'Segment' field values.",
            "mentions": [
              61232
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M41",
            "speaker_id": 472865,
            "reply_to": "M40",
            "text": "That sounds like the right focus. The other issues in the audit, like missing phone numbers, are less critical for the launch itself and can be addressed post-launch.",
