        "thread_id": "TH4",
        "thread_goal": "Define pilot scope, success criteria, and adjustments before full rollout.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M51",
            "speaker_id": 30302,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi everyone, here is a proposal for the pilot program for T10. I was thinking we could invite 50 members for 2 weeks. What do you think?",
            "mentions": [
              61232,
              472865,
              285875,
              117598
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T10"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M52",
            "speaker_id": 61232,
            "reply_to": "M51",
            "text": "Thanks for starting this. To make the feedback actionable, we should be more specific with the cohort. I suggest we select 25 members from our 'High Engagement' segment and 25 from 'Medium Engagement'. This will help us test the appeal of the upsell to Gold/Platinum. Also, let's extend the duration to 3 weeks to give them enough time to use the new benefits.",
            "mentions": [
              30302
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M53",
            "speaker_id": 285875,
            "reply_to": "M52",
            "text": "I like that segmentation. It gives us a much better test case. A 3-week duration also feels right. I support this refined scope.",
            "mentions": [
              61232
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M54",
            "speaker_id": 30302,
            "reply_to": "M52",
            "text": "Ok, that's a much better plan. So 50 members total, split between two segments, for 3 weeks. I'll update the plan.",
            "mentions": [
              61232
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
